Z||000000||jlhuber||11-27-2000||12:02 PM||||What are the technical differences between the '87 & prior gt and the '88 gt front suspension?  Would it be worth the hassle to fit a '88 front suspension on an '86?  What benefits (handling wise) does the '88 have over the other years?  I am looking into picking up an '86 gt in my area, adn got to thinking about stuffing an '88 gt suspension under it.  I know people have done the rear cradle thing, but I am more curious about the front.  Course, I would also like to know how the '88 rear cradle conversion turned out for those who have done it.  Better, worse, worth the hassle?  Thanx for any help anyone can give me.<BR> <P>------------------<BR>--Jess--<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1359159&a=10128385&p=34007300"> <BR>"To each his own"||||reg||5
