Z||000002||msweldon||11-27-2000||01:13 PM||||I'm not a tech guru by any account, but the 88' front suspension CANNOT be just swapped out.  The rear is not bad from what I've heard, but the front would need such extensive modification it would probably be easier to cut off your front and weld an 88' front onto it.  This was Ed Parks/FieroFactory 's recommendation.  Do a search, there are several more threads on this topic with a bit more info.<P>hope this helps,<BR>marc||||reg||1
